<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Cementos Caribe net profits up.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Cementos Caribe net profits up.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombian cement manufacturer Cementos del Caribe reported Tuesday 1996 net profits up 12.96 percent to 52.43 billion pesos compared to 1995.</p>
<p>The company said it plans to distribute 20.69 billion pesos in dividends at 14 pesos per share per month between April 1997 and March 1998.</p>
<p>((--Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
